th a remedy aimed at enabling him to obtain the goods he needs thus meeting his essential need. This rem- edy is the buyer’s equivalent of the seller’s right to resell. 2. The definition of “cover” un- der subsection (1) envisages a series of contracts or sales, as well as a single § 2–712ARTICLE 2. SALES"